  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"assets\\st0056_d65fd4375538.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 171px;\" /></p><p>Power rating of zener diode <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math></p><p>From the diagram above,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Power is given by</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Thus, using Ohm&#39;s law,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
